# Learning Algorithms in the Limit

Papazov and Flammarion (COLT 2025, PMLR 291). The public results include
quantitative enumeration, the reduction from policy trajectories to rational
learning, two impossibility theorems for finite single-tape machines, and
stabilization of maximum-similarity merging for tagged teachers. Lemma 9
has a counterexample on teacher-relative domains and a common-domain repair.
